Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Congratulations! You have been awarded the ASU Scholastic Award of $3,000 per year, a renewable scholarship that you can use over four years at ASU. You can view and accept this award in My ASU under the Finances tab. However, please know that at this time we do not have an official ACT or SAT score on file for you. If you submit an official score to ASU we will automatically reconsider you for possible scholarship upgrades based on the new academic information.
 
Remember to keep checking your Priority Task list on My ASU for any items you need to complete before enrolling.
 
If you haven't done so already, your next step to becoming a Sun Devil is to pay your enrollment deposit in your My ASU. Once you submit your enrollment deposit, you will be able to complete your next steps, including signing up for housing and for orientation, where you will register for classes.  
 
I am happy to answer any questions you may have about your enrollment steps or your latest scholarship award. 

Go Devils!

